{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "advection_2d_x_zero_grad_central",
    "description": "MMS driver: forced-steady linear advection along x on the unit box [0,1]x[0,1] with zero-gradient x-walls, discretized by grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/rules/central_D1x_zero_grad_bc (second-order centered interior, 2nd-order one-sided face columns). Manufactured STEADY solution u*(x) = cos(pi x) — constant in y — held steady by the exactly matching forcing c * gx with gx = du*/dx = -pi sin(pi x): the continuous balance is u_t = -c u*_x + c u*_x = 0, so u(t) = u* for all t and the discrete field drifts only by the spatial truncation of the x-operator. BC COMPATIBILITY (why cos(pi x)): u*_x = -pi sin(pi x) vanishes on BOTH walls (sin(0)=sin(pi)=0) — u* is genuinely zero-gradient-compatible — and its third x-derivative -pi^3(-sin) also vanishes there, so the rule's 2nd-order one-sided face residual is superconvergent (O(dx^3)) and the global drift is clean interior O(dx^2), mirroring the cos^4 polar-cap trick of problems/latlon_advection_meridional_zero_grad.esm. The one-sided x-operator is weakly non-normal, so the transport time is kept short (t=0.03, so c*t=0.03) to stay in the linear-drift regime where the observed order is a pristine 2 through NX=256 (a longer transport slowly pollutes it). The y axis is PASSIVE: u* is constant in y, no y-operator appears, and NY is closed to 8 at the import edge; NX stays open (grid default 64, rebound by the convergence sweep). Geometry contract (grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/grid.esm) fulfilled for the unit box: x0=y0=0, dx=1/NX (observed dividing by the metaparameter name NX per esm-spec 9.7.6), dy=1/NY. BUILD-TIME SCOPE CAVEAT (AGENTS.md): the free-name dx survives only in the runtime rule body; the ic, forcing observed, and test references spell x_i = 0 + (i-1/2)(1/NX) inline from literals and NX, never invoking the grid's x_coord free-name template.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:problem",
      "grid:cartesian_uniform_2d",
      "equation:advection",
      "mms"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Roache, P. J. (2002). Code verification by the method of manufactured solutions. J. Fluids Eng. 124(1), 4-10.",
        "doi": "10.1115/1.1436090"
      },
      {
        "citation": "LeVeque, R. J. (2007). Finite Difference Methods for Ordinary and Partial Differential Equations. SIAM. Section 2.12 (boundary-compatible manufactured solutions and one-sided closures)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "Advection2DxZeroGrad": {
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "../grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/rules/central_D1x_zero_grad_bc.esm",
          "bindings": {
            "NY": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "variables": {
        "u": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "kg/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "x",
            "y"
          ],
          "description": "Advected tracer field over the 2-D [x, y] index sets (constant in y in this problem)."
        },
        "c": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 1.0,
          "description": "Constant transport speed along x; multiplies both the discretized derivative and the manufactured forcing, so the steady MMS balance holds for any value."
        },
        "x0": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0,
          "description": "Left x domain edge a = 0 (unit box): the grid's x0 free name (consumer-supplied geometry contract, grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/grid.esm)."
        },
        "y0": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0,
          "description": "Bottom y domain edge (unit box): the grid's y0 free name (unused here; the solution is constant in y)."
        },
        "dx": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m",
          "description": "x-spacing 1/NX: the grid's dx free name, resolved inside the rewrite rule's expanded body at evaluation. NX is the document-scoped metaparameter, substituted as an integer literal at load (esm-spec 9.7.6), so the convergence sweep keeps dx consistent."
        },
        "dy": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m",
          "description": "y-spacing 1/NY: the grid's dy free name; NY closed to 8 at the import edge."
        },
        "gx": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "kg/m^4",
          "shape": [
            "x",
            "y"
          ],
          "description": "Analytic x-derivative of the manufactured solution: gx(x) = du*/dx = -pi sin(pi x). Constant in time and y; c * gx is the manufactured forcing that holds u* = cos(pi x) steady. Coordinates spelled inline from literals and NX (build-time scope caveat)."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "ic",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "output_idx": [
              "i",
              "j"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "i": {
                "from": "x"
              },
              "j": {
                "from": "y"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "cos",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    3.141592653589793,
                    {
                      "op": "+",
                      "args": [
                        0,
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "-",
                              "args": [
                                "i",
                                0.5
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "/",
                              "args": [
                                1,
                                "NX"
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "D",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ],
            "wrt": "t"
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      "c"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "D",
                    "args": [
                      "u"
                    ],
                    "wrt": "x"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "c",
                  "gx"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dx",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              1,
              "NX"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dy",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              1,
              "NY"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "gx",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "output_idx": [
              "i",
              "j"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "i": {
                "from": "x"
              },
              "j": {
                "from": "y"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                -3.141592653589793,
                {
                  "op": "sin",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        3.141592653589793,
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            0,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "i",
                                    0.5
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    1,
                                    "NX"
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "mms_steady_x_zero_grad",
          "description": "Manufactured steady solution u*(x) = cos(pi x) with c = 1. Derivation: the continuous balance is u_t = -c u*_x + c u*_x = 0 with u*_x = gx = -pi sin(pi x), which vanishes on both walls, so u* is zero-gradient-compatible and the one-sided face residual is superconvergent (see metadata.description); the discrete drift is pure interior O(dx^2). The t=0 assertion pins the ic wiring (reference equals the initial field). The t=0.03 assertion bounds the truncation-driven drift against the SAME steady reference (relative L2 far under the bound at the default NX=64; exact per-resolution errors pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/advection_2d_x_zero_grad_central/golden/errors.json). References evaluate at cell centers x_i = 0 + (i - 1/2)/NX, spelled inline per esm-spec 6.6.5 (build-time evaluation folds literals and metaparameters only).",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.03
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 1e-09
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "aggregate",
                "output_idx": [
                  "i",
                  "j"
                ],
                "args": [],
                "ranges": {
                  "i": {
                    "from": "x"
                  },
                  "j": {
                    "from": "y"
                  }
                },
                "expr": {
                  "op": "cos",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        3.141592653589793,
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            0,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "i",
                                    0.5
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    1,
                                    "NX"
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.03,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 0.001
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "aggregate",
                "output_idx": [
                  "i",
                  "j"
                ],
                "args": [],
                "ranges": {
                  "i": {
                    "from": "x"
                  },
                  "j": {
                    "from": "y"
                  }
                },
                "expr": {
                  "op": "cos",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        3.141592653589793,
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            0,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "i",
                                    0.5
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    1,
                                    "NX"
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
